A simplified fork of: https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl

This repo lets you simulate the Microduck robot in MuJoCo and learn RL policies for it.
It can learn to walk, get up after a fall, kick a ball and roller skate.

You'll need a graphics card that supports CUDA, plus uv and make.

    make sync    # install
    make help    # list every target
